Package: bioBulkR
Title: Utilities for Bulk RNA-Seq Analysis and Visualization
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("zuoanjian", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dnf.zuoanjian@gmail.com")
Description: Reusable functions for routine bulk RNA-seq analysis and
    visualization. The package currently provides an integrated Gene Ontology
    and Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes enrichment workflow with
    multiple publication-oriented plots, and is intended to grow with
    differential expression and downstream network analysis utilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/xianyuyinghua/bioBulkR
